<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Flowers Industries.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Flowers Industries.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schroder Wertheim said it initiated coverage of Flowers Industries Inc with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Flowers Industries gained 3/8 to 17-1/2.</p>
</text>
